{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港島綫往堅尼地城方向的列車服務，恢復非繁忙時間行駛的正常班次。至於往柴灣方向列車服務，整體行車時間調整至需要額外3至5分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n港鐵早前表示，香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛；港鐵人員正處理相關信號設備故障。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:44:33.015443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:22:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:24.479526+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:37:46.970946+00:00","content_hash":"9978541a5c78ce3efb5a56181266b07ca705684c17c6f3754aa31dda9e34ed4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}